Package: dl286d-cups-driver
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, cups
Description: CUPS driver for the Deli DL-286D label printer
 This package ships a raster filter and a ppdc-generated PPD produced via
 USB reverse engineering so that the DL-286D label maker can print reliably
 on Linux systems.
